{
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "kind": "standard",
  "organization": "ScaleDock",
  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers TypeSpec from Microsoft for design-first HTTP APIs across its version lines: TypeSpec 1.x (current, compiler, http, openapi and openapi3 1.16.0, with versioning 0.86.0 at draft posture build) and TypeSpec 0.x (legacy, pre-1.0 and Cadl, upgraded from); no preview line exists. It teaches language basics, @typespec/http routes, parameters, bodies, status codes, files, visibility and authentication, the @typespec/openapi3 emitter with its openapi-versions option (3.0.0, 3.1.0 and 3.2.0, default 3.0.0), the TypeSpec to OpenAPI mapping and @typespec/openapi decorators, API versioning with @typespec/versioning, tsp-openapi3 conversion, project configuration and CLI, and upgrading from 0.x. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions, project setup, language, HTTP, the emitter and versioning.",
